# Krang gives "artifact creatures" flying, trample, indestructible and haste: after Krang (turn 5) the Ornithopter has them (its own flying is printed). On turn 7 Oko's +1 makes the Ornithopter a green Elk creature
# with base 3/3 that has lost all abilities and is no longer an artifact (as in the Mox Sapphire scenario): the type change comes in layer 4, so in layer 6 Krang has no artifact creature to give anything to, and the Elk has no keywords at all.

